The two JSON Schemas in this folder are copies, byte for byte, of the
schemas the STAC community publishes for two of its extensions, kept here
so that the suites can validate the STAC fields RasterLabel writes without
a network:

  label-v1.0.1-schema.json
      https://stac-extensions.github.io/label/v1.0.1/schema.json
      from https://github.com/stac-extensions/label

  projection-v1.1.0-schema.json
      https://stac-extensions.github.io/projection/v1.1.0/schema.json
      from https://github.com/stac-extensions/projection

Both repositories are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
whose text is in LICENSE beside this file. They are test data: no part of
RasterLabel is built from them, and they are not shipped with the plugin.

minischema.py, also here, is part of RasterLabel's suites and is under the
